    "Match three identical 3D items on shelves for pairing or triple matching",
    "Achieve higher scores by tidying and organizing the shelves",
    "Complete additional levels to unlock your preferred products",
    "Utilize boosters and hints to conquer challenging levels",
    "Test your vision and focus with matching sorting games"
